"},"inn":{"xml":"<rss xmlns:a10=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" version=\"2.0\"><channel><title>News from Israel</title><description /><language>en-us</language><copyright>ערוץ 7, www.inn.co.il</copyright><image><url>https://a7.org/images/rss_logo.png</url><title>News from Israel</title><link /></image><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697464</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697464</link><title>Interview | MK Elisha Medan ready to pay the price, awaits the change bloc</title><description>In an interview with Arutz Sheva, Elisha Medan responds to claims that he is Netanyahu's political tool and acknowledges the distrust between the camps, saying, 'I personally am prepared to do anything.'</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:31:32 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697463</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697463</link><title>Disturbing footage from Negev: Kindergarten aide attacked with hammer and screwdriver</title><description>A kindergarten aide in Ar'ara in the Negev was attacked with a hammer and a screwdriver. Police have launched an investigation and are searching for the suspects.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:26:56 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697462</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697462</link><title>Israeli AI breakthrough could predict Alzheimer's years before symptoms appear</title><description>Developed from pioneering research led by Clalit Health Services - Beilinson Hospital, ALZAI Health and Ariel University, the new AI model is marking a major step toward earlier Alzheimer’s risk detection</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:25:08 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697461</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697461</link><title>First response teams reestablished in northern Samaria</title><description>The IDF has begun training first response teams in the communities being reestablished in northern Samaria. Volunteers include Yossi Dagan and residents who returned to Sa-Nur after 21 years.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:14:02 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697460</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697460</link><title>Emotional tribute: Baby named after uncle killed in Gaza battle</title><description>Ariel Eliyahu's son was named Yedidya Lev after the newborn's uncle, Yedidya Eliyahu, who was killed in battle, during a circumcision ceremony at the hesder yeshiva in Safed.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:01:24 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697459</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697459</link><title>20 years on: Abduction of Iranian general questioned about Ron Arad revealed</title><description>According to a New York Times investigation, the Mossad abducted an Iranian general in Istanbul and questioned him for weeks in an attempt to obtain information about Ron Arad.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:37:53 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697458</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697458</link><title>Haredi entrepreneur offers to buy Arkia on condition it ends Shabbat flights</title><description>New York-based haredi entrepreneur Ezra Ungar has made a rival bid for control of Arkia, including a $30 million injection, employee board representation and protection from layoffs. His main condition: ending Shabbat flights.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:30:44 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697457</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697457</link><title>Mark Levin warns Democrats against 'Stalinist show trials' targeting Trump</title><description>Fox News host Mark Levin claims Democrats' planned congressional investigations of President Trump, his family, and private businesses could violate constitutional protections and the separation of powers.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:16:34 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697456</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697456</link><title>Sen. Ted Cruz predicts 'two years of rage' from Democrats, weighs 2028 presidential run</title><description>'We are going to turn Texas red again,' Sen. Ted Cruz predicts multiple Trump impeachments, vows to reclaim Texas for Republicans, and leaves open a 2028 presidential bid.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:31:46 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item><item><guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697455</guid><link>https://www.israelnationalnews.com/flashes/697455</link><title>Suspects cross Dead Sea from Jordan in rubber boats, are arrested</title><description>Six suspects arrived from Jordan in rubber boats on the Dead Sea shore near Ovnat. IDF troops located and arrested all six.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:16:47 +0200</pubDate><enclosure url=\"https://www.israelnationalnews.com/files/pictures/0/0.jpg\" length=\"19000\" type=\"image/webp\" /></item></channel></rss>","fetchedAt":"2026-11-15T12:59:07.864Z"},"jpost":{"xml":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"yes\"?><rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"><channel><generator>NFE/5.0</generator><title>\"when:24h source:Jerusalem Post\" - Google News</title><link>https://news.google.com/search?q=when:24h+source:Jerusalem+Post&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;ceid=US:en</link><language>en-US</language><webMaster>news-webmaster@google.com</webMaster><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Google. All rights reserved. This XML feed is made available solely for the purpose of rendering Google News results within a personal feed reader for personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of the feed is expressly prohibited. By accessing this feed or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:59:38 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Google News</title><url>https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-DR60l-K8vnyi99NZovm9HlXyZwQ85GMDxiwJWzoasZYCUrPuUM_P_4Rb7ei03j-0nRs0c4F=w256</url><link>https://news.google.com/</link><height>256</height><width>256</width></image><description>Google News</description><item><title>Mossad abducted Iranian generals as Israel pursued answers on Ron Arad - The Jerusalem Post</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1uWnYtLUYzZkVCRWk1dlZqS0s2SVFBXzQ2R2xWQWM5UVVTYWNKaVVTVVFmTVhkdU5lMUtjU1VSbW