category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[ceramics]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[pottery]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[art]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[1967 borders]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Teddy Kollek]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3929891</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[In this week's installment, we meet a woman who is carrying on a century-old family tradition, painting the Holy City's history<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/patil-feature-2-e1794220562793-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Peoples of Israel: Patil Karakashian, Jerusalem&#8217;s 4th-generation Armenian ceramicist\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Man to be charged with spying for Iran for ‘ideological motives&#8217;</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/man-to-be-charged-with-spying-for-iran-for-ideological-motives/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:58:36 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israelis spying for Iran]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Mazra'a]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[espionage]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934309</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Wissam Ghaleb Saleh Awad, a resident of northern town of Mazra'a, allegedly photographed strategic facilities, military bases and police stations, identifies with Hezbollah<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/09/F260915CG19-e1789475207693-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Man to be charged with spying for Iran for ‘ideological motives&#8217;\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>He survived the war. Then he had to fight for the help he earned. - Sponsored Content</title>\n\t\t<link>https://toi.li/ttuLX0</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:54:00 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?post_type=spotlight&#038;p=3934331</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Eitan came home from Gaza with PTSD and had to prove it was real. A free JIJ lawyer stayed with him until he was recognized. Adopt a wounded soldier's case.<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/Israel_War_Wounded_Soldiers_23361512396304-2-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"He survived the war. Then he had to fight for the help he earned.\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>&#8216;A great joy&#8217;: Hundreds celebrate as former Gaza hostage Bilal Ziyadne gets married</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/a-great-joy-hundreds-celebrate-as-former-gaza-hostage-bilal-ziyadne-gets-married/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:04:10 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Inside]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Hamas hostages]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Rahat]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Bedouin]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[2023-2025 Israel-Hamas war]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Kibbutz Holit]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934247</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Rahat resident was kidnapped with father, brother and sister from Kibbutz Holit on Oct. 7, was released after 50 days alongside sister; his father and brother were later found dead<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-15-095021-1024x640.png\" title=\"&#8216;A great joy&#8217;: Hundreds celebrate as former Gaza hostage Bilal Ziyadne gets married\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Transportation Ministry delegation heads to Dubai for briefing on flydubai attack probe</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/transportation-ministry-delegation-heads-to-dubai-for-briefing-on-flydubai-attack-probe/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:49:06 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[flydubai Flight 1073]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[UAE United Arab Emirates]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Transportation Ministry]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Moshe Ben Zaken]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934234</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Representatives to meet with local security and airport officials about investigation into September incident and arrangements for restarting flights by foreign and Israeli carriers<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/10/F261001YA026-e1791295324845-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Transportation Ministry delegation heads to Dubai for briefing on flydubai attack probe\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>&#8216;Fauda&#8217; star Lior Raz describes real-life role after sister called from shelter on Oct. 7</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/fauda-star-lior-raz-describes-real-life-role-after-sister-called-from-shelter-on-oct-7/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:21:48 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Lior Raz]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Fauda]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[2023-2025 Israel-Hamas war]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Avi Issacharoff]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934216</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Actor, a former covert unit operative, was in Romania when he found out his sister was hiding with terrorists outside; after rushing back to country, he helped in aftermath<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-12-182445-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"&#8216;Fauda&#8217; star Lior Raz describes real-life role after sister called from shelter on Oct. 7\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Toddler briefly disappears at Ben Gurion Airport; found on baggage conveyor belt</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/toddler-briefly-disappears-at-ben-gurion-airport-found-on-baggage-conveyor-belt/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:20:10 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Inside]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Ben Gurion Airport]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Airports Authority]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Police]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?post_type=liveblog_entry&#038;p=3934220</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[In incident last week, family checking in for flight lost 2-year-old son for several minutes before baggage staff found him in the sorting and loading area; police investigating<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/F261025AVS0004-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Toddler briefly disappears at Ben Gurion Airport; found on baggage conveyor belt\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Chief of Hamas&#8217;s Rafah Brigade killed in Israeli strike, 2 months after predecessor</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/chief-of-hamass-rafah-brigade-killed-in-israeli-strike-2-months-after-predecessor/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:30:53 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israeli strikes on Gaza]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Gaza Strip]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Hamas]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[IDF Israel Defense Forces]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Rafah]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Khan Younis]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934213</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Military targets veteran Hamas commander Samir Abu Younis as he walks down street in southern Gaza's Khan Younis, both IDF and terror group confirm<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/photo_2026-11-15_09-09-40-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Chief of Hamas&#8217;s Rafah Brigade killed in Israeli strike, 2 months after predecessor\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Shin Bet asked Joint List activists for info on rival Ra&#8217;am in vote fraud probe &#8212; report</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/shin-bet-asked-joint-list-activists-for-info-on-rival-raam-in-vote-fraud-probe-report/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:30:14 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Inside]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israeli politics]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Joint List]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Ra'am party (United Arab List)]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel Police]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[2026 Israeli election]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[voter fraud]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934193</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[One activist tells Channel 12 that police interrogated him in attempt to recruit him as informant; Shin Bet says it's acting 'in accordance with its legal authority'<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/10/AFP__20261027__D4LX4AY__v4__HighRes__IsraelVote-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Shin Bet asked Joint List activists for info on rival Ra&#8217;am in vote fraud probe &#8212; report\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>Yashar, Likud to hold talks on potential unity as Eisenkot&#8217;s party denies considering rotation deal</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/liveblog-november-15-2026/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:28:35 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[Liveblog]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934188</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Democrats party representative to chair new panel tasked with repealing overhaul * Reports: Settlers attack house, vandalize two vehicles in West Bank, no injuries<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/F261110CG551-e1794680320263-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"Yashar, Likud to hold talks on potential unity as Eisenkot&#8217;s party denies considering rotation deal\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t\t\t\t<item>\n        <title>US aviation shutdown blamed on single installed router undergoing routine maintenance</title>\n\t\t<link>https://www.timesofisrael.com/us-aviation-shutdown-blamed-on-l3-harris-installed-router-undergoing-routine-maintenance/</link>\n\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:07:57 +0000</pubDate>\n\t\t\t\t<category><![CDATA[Israel & the Region]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[US Department of Transportation]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[L3Harris]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[flight disruptions]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[aviation]]></category>\n\t\t<category><![CDATA[air travel]]></category>\n\t\t<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://www.timesofisrael.com/?p=3934183</guid>\n\t\t<description><![CDATA[Incident is latest in a string of mishaps for aging air traffic control telecom system, with routers that should have been replaced in 2006 thought to be culprit for mass failure<figure><img src=\"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/11/AP26318479897374-1024x640.jpg\" title=\"US aviation shutdown blamed on single installed router undergoing routine maintenance\" border=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></figure>]]></description>\n\t</item>\n \t</channel>\n</rss>\n","fetchedAt":"2026-11-15T12:59:07.864Z"},"ynet":{"xml":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n            <rss version=\"2.0\">\n                <channel>\n                    <title><![CDATA[ynet - מבזקים]]></title>\n                    <link><![CDATA[https://www.ynet.co.il]]></link>\n                    <description><![CDATA[עדכוני SMS ישירות מחדר החדשות של ynet. שילחו את המילים ''התחל חדשות'' למספר 5335 וקבלו 4 עדכוני SMS ביום. השירות בתשלום.]]></description>\n                    <copyright><![CDATA[Ynet - news and content from Israel (Yedioth Ahronoth web site)]]></copyright>\n                    <language><![CDATA[he]]></language>\n                    <pubDate><![CDATA[Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:38:30 +0200]]></pubDate>\n                    <image>\n                        <title><![CDATA[Ynet]]></title>\n                        <link><![CDATA[https://www.ynet.co.il/home/0,7340,L-1854,00.html]]></link>\n                        <url><![CDATA[http://www.ynet.co.il/images/CENTRAL_logo.gif]]></url>\n                    </image>\n                    <lastBuildDate><![CDATA[Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:55:19 +0200]]></lastBuildDate>\n                    \n                <item>\n                    <title><![CDATA[חבר קונגרס אמריקני: נציגי אנבידיה הודו שהחברה מסוגלת לעקוב אחר שבבי ה-AI]]></title>\n                    <description><![CDATA[]]></description>\n                    <link><![CDATA[https://www.ynet.co.il/news/article/hkagl7pafe]]></link>\n                    <pubDate><![CDATA[Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:38:30 +