ami-airport_1794717443700_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"Tomas Maliar\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/miami-airport_1794717443700_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"901\" credit=\"Tomas Maliar\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>3</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[ UPS plane, Copa Airlines flight collide on taxiway at Miami International Airport]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/US/ups-plane-copa-airlines-flight-collide-taxiway-miami/story?id=138152923]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/US/ups-plane-copa-airlines-flight-collide-taxiway-miami/story?id=138152923]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:13:53 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[Two people were treated on the scene for minor injuries, airport officials said.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>US</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/wirestory_8a15143716d2d78a691f2eb995f1bda0_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>4</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[ Pope crosses Peru in finale of trip home to visit flock high in Andes, deep in Amazon]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/pope-crosses-peru-finale-trip-home-visit-flock-138155337]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/pope-crosses-peru-finale-trip-home-visit-flock-138155337]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:42:46 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[The plight of Indigenous peoples and the protection of the Amazon take center stage on Pope Leo XIV&rsquo;s penultimate day in Peru as he visits communities in the Andes and the rainforest]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>International</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_scott_skylar7_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>5</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[WATCH:  Skylar's big surprise by the New England Patriots]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138141298/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138141298/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 04:21:31 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[Sixteen-year-old Skylar, a pediatric cancer patient, got an extra surprise from New England Patriots quarterback Drake Maye while spending a day baking with Ann Michael Maye.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>GMA</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261114_gma_ganss_school3_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>6</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[WATCH:  Elementary school named after beloved custodian]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138140631/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138140631/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:38:38 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[Marilyn Hampton was a beloved custodian for the Aubrey Independent School District outside Dallas, Texas. She was surprised with a school named in her honor, Marilyn Hampton Elementary School.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>GMA</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_play_punch2_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>7</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[WATCH:  Heartwarming update on Punch the Monkey]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138104775/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138104775/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:56:39 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[The baby macaque at Japan’s Ichikawa City Zoo became a viral sensation after turning to an IKEA toy for comfort. Nine months later, Punch has joined the troop and taken an interest in a baby macaque.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>GMA</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/261113_gmafl_class_trip_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>8</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[WATCH:  School's ultimate class trip heads to Antarctica]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138103628/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138103628/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:29:45 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[ABC News' Danny New reports on a group of middle schoolers in Maryland who are about to get the snow day of their lives in the form of a class trip to Antarctica.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>US</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/GMA/261113_gma_whit1_hpMain_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/