ights]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138074238/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138074238/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:28:24 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[The airline says customers who give their personal and credit card information to AI businesses run the risk of having their sensitive data exposed.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>GMA</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain.jpg_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain.jpg_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain.jpg_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain_16x9_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain.jpg_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/International/261112_gmafl_ultrarunnerr_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"ABCNews.com\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>13</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[WATCH:  Mom becomes first woman to run 100 miles in Antarctica]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138072943/]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/video/138072943/]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:56:12 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<descr