-gmh-261113_1794591677951_hpMain_16x9t_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"Getty Images/AP Photo\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/schumer-hollen-1-gty-gmh-261113_1794591677951_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"Getty Images/AP Photo\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/schumer-hollen-1-gty-gmh-261113_1794591677951_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"Getty Images/AP Photo\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/schumer-hollen-1-gty-gmh-261113_1794591677951_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"Getty Images/AP Photo\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>19</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[ Schumer and Van Hollen face off for Senate majority leader. What do Democrats think?]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/Politics/schumer-van-hollen-facing-off-senate-majority-leader/story?id=138111386]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/Politics/schumer-van-hollen-facing-off-senate-majority-leader/story?id=138111386]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:02:06 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[Within moments of Chris Van Hollen announcing his intent to challenge Chuck Schumer in a race to lead next year’s Senate Democratic majority, endorsements began flying.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>Politics</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/Boebert-gty-er-261113_1794602878704_hpMain_4x3t_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"Anna Moneymaker/Getty Images\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/Boebert-gty-er-261113_1794602878704_hpMain_4x3t_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"Anna Moneymaker/Getty Images\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/Boebert-gty-er-261113_1794602878704_hpMain_4x3t_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"Anna Money