84.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"Julia Demaree Nikhinson/AP, FILE\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/huang-1-ap-er-261112_1794504652857_hpMain_16x9t_240.jpg\" width=\"240\" height=\"135\" credit=\"Julia Demaree Nikhinson/AP, FILE\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/huang-1-ap-er-261112_1794504652857_hpMain_4x3_608.jpg\" width=\"608\" height=\"456\" credit=\"Julia Demaree Nikhinson/AP, FILE\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/huang-1-ap-er-261112_1794504652857_hpMain_16x9_992.jpg\" width=\"992\" height=\"558\" credit=\"Julia Demaree Nikhinson/AP, FILE\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/Politics/huang-1-ap-er-261112_1794504652857_hpMain_16x9_1600.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" credit=\"Julia Demaree Nikhinson/AP, FILE\" />\n\t\t\t<media:keywords>21</media:keywords>\n\t\t\t<title><![CDATA[ Republicans push for Jensen Huang's testimony following Nvidia CEO's resignation]]></title>\n\t\t\t<link><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/Politics/republicans-renew-push-jensen-huangs-testimony-nvidia-ceos/story?id=138083749]]></link>\n\t\t\t<guid><![CDATA[https://abcnews.com/Politics/republicans-renew-push-jensen-huangs-testimony-nvidia-ceos/story?id=138083749]]></guid>\n\t\t\t<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:07:55 -0500</pubDate>\n\t\t\t<description><![CDATA[\"I don't think he's got anything to hide now. Let it fly,\" Rep. Burchett said.]]></description>\n\t\t\t<category>Politics</category>\n\t\t\t</item><item><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/wirestory_9fc9b226f25e5c371db6021170b70d27_4x3_384.jpg\" width=\"384\" height=\"288\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/wirestory_9fc9b226f25e5c371db6021170b70d27_4x3_144.jpg\" width=\"144\" height=\"108\" credit=\"The Associated Press\" /><media:thumbnail url=\"https://s.abcnews.com/images/US/wirestory_9fc9b226f25e5c371db6021170b70d27_4x3_384.jpg\" 